DESCRIPTION:National Jukebox Day falls on the Wednesday before Thanksgiving
 \, which puts it on November 25 in 2026. It is a trade promotion rather th
 an a civic observance: a jukebox company declared it in 2016 and picked th
 e date because the night before Thanksgiving is the busiest bar night of t
 he year. The machine it points back to is far better documented than the d
 ay itself.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/national-jukebox-day/
